      <description><![CDATA[<ul><li>Japanese and Korean games and programs without Unicode support now run with their own code page (932 or 949), even when your Mac uses another language: PortWin recognizes them by Japanese or Korean characters in their name and in the files next to them. Before, such games could quit silently.</li><li>After an update, PortWin shows what’s new; the full history is in Help → Change History.</li></ul>]]></description>
